    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements a design example using the SPI controller in slave mode. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The example performs transfers in polled mode and has been tested with Aardvark Analyzer as Master. The example echoes data which it receives from the master. The slave controller expects MAX_DATA bytes of data from the master to transmit onto the SPI bus which the slave receives into its Rx buffer. It polls until the Rx FIFO is filled with the Threshold limit of data which is set to MAX_DATA. On sending data, the master receives dummy bytes in response. Master has to send MAX_DATA dummy bytes to read back the echoed data.</para><para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The slave mode test needs an external master to send data to the Spi device. The example has been tested with Aardvark Analyzer as Master. The Clock Polarity and Phase should match between master and the slave.</para></simplesect>
<preformatted>
